/**
 * Japanese locale bundle (ja) — full translation of the English message catalog.
 *
 * Consumed through the existing config-time seam: pass this bundle (or any
 * deep-partial slice of it) as `PhlixAppConfig.messages`. Key set and plural
 * segment counts are pinned against `DEFAULT_MESSAGES` by `locales.test.ts`.
 *
 * UTF-8, no BOM. File must be saved without BOM (Japanese review convention).
 *
 * Language decisions (flagged for review):
 * - Polite desu/masu register (standard consumer media UI), concise labels.
 * - CLDR Japanese has ONE plural category: every pipe-form English message
 *   collapses to a SINGLE segment here — no '|' anywhere in this file. Counters
 *   carry the grammar: 人 (people), 枚 (albums), 曲 (tracks), 件 (items).
 * - Brand/product terms kept verbatim in Latin: Phlix, SyncPlay, the theme
 *   names Nocturne / Daylight / Midnight, the badge SDH, ⌘K, HDR, ID, hub, the
 *   example address placeholders (you@example.com, your-server), units Kbps
 *   and the p in ({height}p).
 * - No invented jargon: only mainstream Japanese UI vocabulary is used —
 *   再生・一時停止・シャッフル・キュー・チャプター・トランスコード・
 *   ペアレンタルコントロール・ピクチャー・イン・ピクチャー.
 * - Full-width punctuation （）：、。and 「」quotes per Japanese platform
 *   convention; ASCII placeholders ({count} etc.) kept byte-intact.
 *
 * @copyright 2026 Joe Huss <detain@interserver.net>
 * @license MIT
 */

